# NOTE: public/models/{props,facade} and manifest.json used to be ignored as
# "reproducible, do not commit". That stopped being true the moment src/
# started loading them: world/catalogue.js reads manifest.json at boot and the
# city is dressed from those 91 assets, so a fresh clone without them renders a
# different game. They are 1.7 MB. They ship.

# scratch the browser harness drops at the repo root mid-session
/*.jpg
/*.txt
/*.png
/*.mp4

# harness output, regenerated every run
.playwright-mcp/


